<view class="page home-page"><view class="row"><text class="eyebrow" bindtap="account">花与爪 · 我的账号 ↗</text><text class="link" bindtap="saved">♡ 我的收藏</text></view><view class="home-hero"><view class="title">爱花，也爱它。<view>让每一份好奇都安心</view></view><view class="muted">给爱花的铲屎官，一本有依据的植物手册。</view></view><view class="home-search"><button class="search-submit" bindtap="search" aria-label="搜索植物">⌕</button><input placeholder="搜索植物名称、别名或学名" value="{{q}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search"/></view><view class="camera" bindtap="identify"><view><view class="name">不认识这株植物？</view><view class="camera-sub">拍一张，先认识，再靠近 →</view></view><text class="camera-art">❀</text></view><view class="common-plants"><view class="common-heading"><view class="name">从常见植物开始</view><text class="muted">认识身边的花草</text></view><view class="common-grid"><button class="common-plant" wx:for="{{commonPlants}}" wx:key="name" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="quickSearch"><text class="common-symbol">{{item.symbol}}</text><view class="common-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="common-hint">{{item.hint}} ↗</view></button></view><view class="common-note">按名称查询，先核对身份，再了解猫狗风险。</view></view><view class="home-journal" bindtap="checklist" role="button"><view class="journal-kicker">BEFORE YOU BRING IT HOME</view><view class="journal-title">买花之前，<view>留一分钟给它。</view></view><view class="journal-bottom"><text>养宠家庭的买花小清单</text><text class="journal-arrow">↗</text></view><image class="journal-garden" src="/assets/brand/garden-line.svg" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view><view class="home-endnote">让喜欢的花，也成为安心的日常。</view></view>
